      "status": "not_affected",
      "justification": "vulnerable_code_not_in_execute_path",
      "impact_statement": "The flaw crashes an HTTP/1 server (net/http MaxBytesReader). It is in the rclone binary, which Backuparr runs only as a client (copyto, lsjson, lsd, about, deletefile, config); it never starts rclone's servers (serve, rcd)."
    },
