      "status": "not_affected",
      "justification": "vulnerable_code_not_in_execute_path",
      "impact_statement": "The advisory flags the deprecated golang.org/x/crypto/openpgp package, compiled into rclone for storage backends Backuparr doesn't use. Backuparr uses rclone's Local, Google Drive, OneDrive and Dropbox backends, and never runs rclone selfupdate (which uses a maintained OpenPGP library anyway)."
